# NOT READ BY OXFMT. Put format excludes in .prettierignore.
#
# oxfmt reads .gitignore and .prettierignore by default (`oxfmt --help`:
# "If not specified, .gitignore and .prettierignore in the current directory
# are used"), and nothing in this repository passes `--ignore-path` for this
# file. Entries here never took effect: the 18 that were listed (desktop,
# scripts, .github, openspec and others) were formatted all along.
#
# This file is kept, empty of entries, so nobody adds one expecting it to work.
# See docs/development/git-hooks.md, "Which ignore file the formatter reads".
